// the 44 trace rows of `rules/trace-contract.md` (2026-11-11, baseline
// `4a1ac08b`), the 165 rows of `rules/protocol-registry-1.md` (2026-11-11,
// baseline `b86dfdcf`), the 218 rows of `rules/protocol-registry-2.md`
// (2026-11-14, baseline `b41e3904`), the 350 rows of
