// 246 current and 104 replaced in the issue. The rule wording stays the issue
// snapshot's (`rules/protocol-session.md`); each entry re-extracts where the
// rule lives in 0.22 and what carries it:
//
//   - `protocol-session.md §11` plus the `SESS-*` ids that state the rule,
//     where the session specification is now the source;
